{
  "_comment": [
    "The status map (docs/gameplay/11_BATTLE_DATA.md Â§4.2; src/core/game/systems/battle_rules.h): for each fighter's look,",
    "what each status shows: clip (its name in the fighter's .anim; empty: the status's own name), sound (a sound id in",
    "media/sfx) and fx (an effect in media/fx/battle.particle). base: another look whose states this one starts from.",
    "A monster names its look in enemies.json \"look\" (none: \"monster\"); the player's is \"player\".",
    "Statuses: idle, attack, hurt, die, special, transform, parry, broken. A monster's clip is looked up as",
    "<clip>_<monster id> first (its own), then <clip> (monster_battle.anim)."
  ],
  "monster": {
    "states": {
      "idle": {},
      "attack": { "sound": "enemy_attack" },
      "hurt": {},
      "die": {},
      "special": { "fx": "monster_special" },
      "transform": { "fx": "monster_transform" },
      "parry": { "clip": "hurt", "fx": "monster_parried" },
      "broken": { "clip": "hurt", "fx": "monster_broken" }
    }
  },
  "player": {
    "states": {
      "attack": { "sound": "player_attack" },
      "parry": { "sound": "confirm_click", "fx": "sword_release_2" }
    }
  }
}
{
  "_comment": [
    "Reward events (docs/gameplay/07 phase 6; src/core/game/systems/mini_game.h): a timing game that earns gold or crystals,",
    "started from any dialogue choice: {\"type\": \"miniGame\", \"id\": \"<key here>\"}. The play is Battle v3's point play:",
    "points (1-5) on a track, a marker sweeping it (sweepMs; turnBack; maxSweeps), a tap within hitWindow of a point hits",
    "it. Each hit earns perHit of the currency (gold or crystals), every point hit bonusAll more; two misses in a row end",
    "it with nothing. limit: plays a run (0: no limit). title / text: per language; a language missing falls back (en,",
    "then any), so crystal_shrine, written in Traditional Chinese only, shows Chinese in every language (the owner's test)."
  ],
  "chest_lockpick": {
    "title": {
